WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
- [Kelly] We have time for
one more story before we go.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.330
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.660
Disney World is known as
the happiest place on earth,

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.340
but as many parents will tell you,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.080
preparation is key people.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.380
If you're not mentally,
physically, and financially ready

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.240
the Magic Kingdom will eat you alive

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.280
and will be a day from hell.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.350
A Pennsylvania dad understands this.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.840
He's posted his Disney workouts online.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.673
Here you go.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.103
(upbeat music)

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.787
That is so true.

00:00:51.787 --> 00:00:54.060
I'm like, I ain't carrying
you around this park.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.380
My kids are always asking me.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.293
So I say hi to Matt and his wife Rachel.

00:00:59.468 --> 00:01:00.301
- [Rachel] Hi

00:01:00.301 --> 00:01:01.134
(cheering)

00:01:01.134 --> 00:01:01.967
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:01.967 --> 00:01:02.800
- Hi Kelly.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.633
- [Kelly] Matt...

00:01:03.633 --> 00:01:04.658
- Thank you so much for having...

00:01:04.658 --> 00:01:05.491
- Oh my god

00:01:05.491 --> 00:01:06.324
- I'm such a huge fan.

00:01:06.324 --> 00:01:07.157
- I love y'all

00:01:07.157 --> 00:01:08.190
and I love that you're
putting these videos out

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.870
'cause this is totally what my kids

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.940
you're nice, apparently,
Matt, you'll actually do it.

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.640
But I'm like, nah, God gave
you two legs you can walk.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.730
This video looks like it was born

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.380
out of hard earned experience.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.430
So is that true, Matt?

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:22.740
Are you usually carrying them
like that all over the park?

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.210
- It sure is, Kelly.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.340
When you have a wife that loves Disney

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:30.322
and you have four small girls
ranging from nine to two

00:01:30.322 --> 00:01:33.360
I'd say I've had a lot
of practice with this.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.560
You have someone who likes
to plan down to the minute.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:39.240
So I've had plenty of times

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.974
where I've walked 20,000 plus steps a day.

00:01:41.974 --> 00:01:42.807
- Oh my God.

00:01:42.807 --> 00:01:44.580
- You know, tried to
navigate the double stroller

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.280
through Main Street and had two kids

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:48.870
on my shoulders in 90 degree heat.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:52.290
So you know it, it's definitely
an intense experience.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.580
- I sometimes it's like

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.710
while being the happiest place
on earth for your children

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.620
it's like the opposite
for the parents sometimes.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.870
So Rachel, this was so popular

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.600
that you made several other
training videos, right?

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.762
- Yes. So when you have
as many kids as we have

00:02:06.762 --> 00:02:08.100
ranging with the ages that they are,

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.200
we've experienced just about everything

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.690
that there is possibly
to experience in Disney.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.170
So we created two more
videos with our family

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.380
on experiences and those
have also gone viral.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.000
And then we recently created one

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.300
with my father-in-law
about grandpas at Disney

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.590
and that's gone viral too.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:28.320
So it's just so relatable because I feel

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.450
like all parents kind of deal with this,

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.990
but we we do it to give our
kids the magical experience

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.310
that we wanna give them.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.310
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:37.442 --> 00:02:41.730
It's the hanging on the pole
while trying to, oh my God.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.860
It's all so true and relatable.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:44.700
I love y'all.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.070
Thank you so much Matt and Rachel.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:48.360
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.193
Right.

00:02:50.308 --> 00:02:51.344
- [Matt] Thank you.

00:02:51.344 --> 00:02:52.308
- [Rachel] Thank you, Kelly.

00:02:52.308 --> 00:02:53.909
- That's not all. Our season long partner,

00:02:53.909 --> 00:02:56.340
Pilot Pen, makers of Frixion,
the go-to erasable pen

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.770
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,
want to help you prepare

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:01.620
for your next Disney vacation,
at least financially.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.669
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:03:04.669 --> 00:03:05.538
- Wow!

00:03:05.538 --> 00:03:07.756
- Wow, thank you so much.

00:03:07.756 --> 00:03:08.808
- [Kelly] I love your family.

00:03:08.808 --> 00:03:09.703
- Thank you so much.

00:03:09.703 --> 00:03:11.351
- [Kelly] You're hilarious.

00:03:11.351 --> 00:03:12.184
Thank you for joining us and thank you

00:03:12.184 --> 00:03:13.020
to all our guests this hour.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.350
Riley Keough, Suki
Waterhouse, Camila Morrone,

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:20.400
Taylor Jenkins Reid,
Sadaya, Dora, and Sunny War.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.233
Y'all have a great day.

00:03:21.233 --> 00:03:22.930
And if it's not, try and change it.

